    "answer": "THESEUS_PLAN_V1\nPLAN\nModify `iter_config_dirs` and `iter_data_dirs` in `src/platformdirs/unix.py` to check if `use_site_for_root` is active. If active, filter out the user directory from `_site_config_dirs` and `_site_data_dirs` respectively before yielding, preventing duplication while maintaining the user-first order when the flag is inactive.\nTARGET\nsrc/platformdirs/unix.py 200 208\n<<<\n    def iter_config_dirs(self) -> Iterator[str]:\n        \"\"\":yield: all user and site configuration directories.\"\"\"\n        yield self.user_config_dir\n        if not self._use_site_for_root:\n            yield from self._site_config_dirs\n        else:\n            # When use_site_for_root is active, omit the duplicate user directory from site dirs\n            for d in self._site_config_dirs:\n                if d != self.user_config_dir:\n                    yield d\n\n    def iter_data_dirs(self) -> Iterator[str]:\n        \"\"\":yield: all user and site data directories.\"\"\"\n        yield self.user_data_dir\n        if not self._use_site_for_root:\n            yield from self._site_data_dirs\n        else:\n            # When use_site_for_root is active, omit the duplicate user directory from site dirs\n            for d in self._site_data_dirs:\n                if d != self.user_data_dir:\n                    yield d\n>>>\nEND",
